# Current scene: {{ scene.title }} (id: {{ scene.id }})
{% if scene.read_aloud %}
Read-aloud text: {{ scene.read_aloud }}
{% endif %}
{% if private_context and scene.dm_notes %}
DM notes: {{ scene.dm_notes }}
{% endif %}
{% if npcs %}
NPCs here:
{% for npc in npcs %}
- {{ npc.name }} (id: {{ npc.id }}), attitude: {{ npc.attitude }}{% if npc.description %}. Looks: {{ npc.description }}{% endif %}{% if private_context and npc.personality %}. Personality: {{ npc.personality }}{% endif %}{% if private_context and npc.secrets %}. Secrets (DM only): {{ npc.secrets | join(" ") }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if dead_npcs %}
Dead here (corpses — NEVER describe as alive, speaking or acting):
{% for npc in dead_npcs %}
- {{ npc.name }} (id: {{ npc.id }}) — dead

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if private_context and checks %}
Prepared checks (use as scene_check):
{% for check in checks %}
- {{ check.id }}: {{ check.kind }} {{ check.subject }}{% if check.dc %} DC {{ check.dc }}{% endif %}{% if check.when %} — when: {{ check.when }}{% endif %}{% if check.reveals %} — on success reveals: {{ check.reveals | join(", ") }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if entities %}
Clues, items and handouts here:
{% for entity in entities %}
- {{ entity.id }} [{{ entity.status }}]: {{ entity.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if private_context and encounters %}
Encounters here:
{% for encounter in encounters %}
- {{ encounter.id }}: {{ encounter.title }} — {{ encounter.creatures }}{% if encounter.description %}. {{ encounter.description }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if exits %}
Exits (the ONLY reachable locations from this scene; travel is possible only to these):
{% for exit in exits %}
- {{ exit.id }}: {{ exit.title }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if rest %}
Authored rest in this scene (private mechanics; use only on a player's request):
- {{ rest.id }}: {{ rest.name }}; status {{ rest.status }}; restores {{ rest.resources | join(", ") }}; requires recorded party victory in one of {{ rest.after_encounters | join(", ") }}.
If available, call take_rest with the requesting party member's actor_id and this exact rest_id. A used or locked rest has no effect.
{% endif %}

# Party status
{% for member in party %}
- {{ member.name }} (id: {{ member.id }}): HP {{ member.hp }}, AC {{ member.ac }}{% if member.conditions %}, conditions: {{ member.conditions }}{% endif %}{% if member['items'] %}, found items: {{ member['items'] }}{% endif %}{% if member.equipment %}, equipped: {{ member.equipment }}{% endif %}{% if member.skills %}, class skills: {{ member.skills }}{% endif %}{% if member.protected_by %}, protected by {{ member.protected_by }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% if revealed %}

# Already discovered by the players
{% for line in revealed %}
- {{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if private_context and facts %}

# Your notes
{% for fact in facts %}
- {{ fact }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if fragments %}

# Relevant scenario fragments (search; may lie outside the current scene)
{% for line in fragments %}
{{ line }}
{% endfor %}
Background knowledge only: do not reveal DM-only fragments to players, and do not treat them as committed outcomes or invent rolls from them.
{% endif %}

{% if scene_update %}
# State update after change_scene
This is the current scene. It supersedes the previous scene snapshot for subsequent tool calls and narration. The players have not taken another action.
{% elif opening %}
# Session start
Open the session: set the scene for the players using the read-aloud text and give them a reason to act.
{% elif actions %}
# Players' actions
{% for action in actions %}
- {{ action.name }} (id: {{ action.actor_id }}): {{ action.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
